# ---- Markdown is ignored by default ----
# Agent notes, plans, reviews, drafts and dated write-ups stay on disk but out
# of git. Real documentation is re-included by name; add a line here for a
# new doc (or `git add -f` it).
*.md
!README.md
!AGENTS.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!LICENSE.md

# Tracked on purpose: the Planck common mask the tests read
!data/planck_common_mask_int_ns64.fits
